{"id":"a77ce8f30d1f4008","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/631_线性时序逻辑_LTL.md","title":"631 线性时序逻辑 LTL","display":"631_线性时序逻辑_LTL","type":"system","metadata":{},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[],"html":"<p><span class=\"inline-tag\">#FormalSystem</span></p>\n\n<h1 id=\"1.-符号表\">1. 符号表</h1>\n<p>令</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb N=\\{0,1,2,\\ldots\\},\n\\qquad\n\\mathsf{Prop}_{631}=\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathbb N=\\{0,1,2,\\ldots\\},\n\\qquad\n\\mathsf{Prop}_{631}=\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>有限包含记号定义为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"X\\subseteq_{\\mathrm{fin}}Y\n\\Longleftrightarrow\nX\\subseteq Y\\text{ 且 }X\\text{ 有限}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[X\\subseteq_{\\mathrm{fin}}Y\n\\Longleftrightarrow\nX\\subseteq Y\\text{ 且 }X\\text{ 有限}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>原始构造子为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{atom},\\quad\\bot,\\quad\\operatorname{neg},\\quad\\operatorname{imp},\\quad\\operatorname{next},\\quad\\operatorname{until}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{atom},\\quad\\bot,\\quad\\operatorname{neg},\\quad\\operatorname{imp},\\quad\\operatorname{next},\\quad\\operatorname{until}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>显示记号：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"XA=\\operatorname{next}(A),\\qquad A\\,U\\,B=\\operatorname{until}(A,B).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[XA=\\operatorname{next}(A),\\qquad A\\,U\\,B=\\operatorname{until}(A,B).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>派生记号：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\top=(\\bot\\to\\bot),\\quad\nA\\land B=\\neg(A\\to\\neg B),\\quad\nA\\lor B=\\neg A\\to B,\\quad\nA\\leftrightarrow B=(A\\to B)\\land(B\\to A),\\quad\nFA=\\top\\,U\\,A,\\quad\nGA=\\neg F\\neg A.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\top=(\\bot\\to\\bot),\\quad\nA\\land B=\\neg(A\\to\\neg B),\\quad\nA\\lor B=\\neg A\\to B,\\quad\nA\\leftrightarrow B=(A\\to B)\\land(B\\to A),\\quad\nFA=\\top\\,U\\,A,\\quad\nGA=\\neg F\\neg A.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>无绑定构造子。</p>\n<h1 id=\"2.-公式\">2. 公式</h1>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Frm}_{631}\">\\(\\mathsf{Frm}_{631}\\)</span> 是满足下列条件的最小集合：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}_{631}\">\\(p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}_{631}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{atom}(p)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{631}\">\\(\\operatorname{atom}(p)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{631}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bot\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{631}\">\\(\\bot\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{631}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{631}\">\\(A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{631}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{631}\">\\(\\neg A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{631}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{631}\">\\(A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{631}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\to B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{631}\">\\(A\\to B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{631}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{631}\">\\(A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{631}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"XA\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{631}\">\\(XA\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{631}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{631}\">\\(A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{631}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\,U\\,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{631}\">\\(A\\,U\\,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{631}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<h1 id=\"3.-自由变元\">3. 自由变元</h1>\n<p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{631}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{631}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Prop}_{631})\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{631}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{631}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Prop}_{631})\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>如下。</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{631}(\\operatorname{atom}(p))=\\{p\\},\\quad\n\\operatorname{FV}_{631}(\\bot)=\\varnothing,\\quad\n\\operatorname{FV}_{631}(\\neg A)=\\operatorname{FV}_{631}(A),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{631}(\\operatorname{atom}(p))=\\{p\\},\\quad\n\\operatorname{FV}_{631}(\\bot)=\\varnothing,\\quad\n\\operatorname{FV}_{631}(\\neg A)=\\operatorname{FV}_{631}(A),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{631}(A\\to B)=\\operatorname{FV}_{631}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{631}(B),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{631}(A\\to B)=\\operatorname{FV}_{631}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{631}(B),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{631}(XA)=\\operatorname{FV}_{631}(A),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{631}(XA)=\\operatorname{FV}_{631}(A),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{631}(A\\,U\\,B)=\\operatorname{FV}_{631}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{631}(B).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{631}(A\\,U\\,B)=\\operatorname{FV}_{631}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{631}(B).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BV}_{631}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{631}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Prop}_{631})\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{BV}_{631}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{631}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Prop}_{631})\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>为常空函数：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BV}_{631}(A)=\\varnothing\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{BV}_{631}(A)=\\varnothing\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{631}\">\\(A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{631}\\)</span> 成立。LTL 没有绑定构造子。</p>\n<h1 id=\"4.-命题替换\">4. 命题替换</h1>\n<p>对函数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma:\\mathsf{Prop}_{631}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{631}\">\\(\\sigma:\\mathsf{Prop}_{631}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{631}\\)</span> 定义支撑：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{supp}_{631}(\\sigma)\n=\n\\{p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}_{631}:\\sigma(p)\\ne\\operatorname{atom}(p)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{supp}_{631}(\\sigma)\n=\n\\{p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}_{631}:\\sigma(p)\\ne\\operatorname{atom}(p)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Subst}_{631}\">\\(\\mathsf{Subst}_{631}\\)</span> 为所有满足</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{supp}_{631}(\\sigma)\\subseteq_{\\mathrm{fin}}\\mathsf{Prop}_{631}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{supp}_{631}(\\sigma)\\subseteq_{\\mathrm{fin}}\\mathsf{Prop}_{631}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>的函数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma:\\mathsf{Prop}_{631}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{631}\">\\(\\sigma:\\mathsf{Prop}_{631}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{631}\\)</span> 的集合。定义替换扩张函数</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PSub}_{631}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{631}\\times\\mathsf{Subst}_{631}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{631}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{PSub}_{631}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{631}\\times\\mathsf{Subst}_{631}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{631}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>记</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PSub}_{631}(A,\\sigma)=\\widehat\\sigma(A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{PSub}_{631}(A,\\sigma)=\\widehat\\sigma(A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma\\in\\mathsf{Subst}_{631}\">\\(\\sigma\\in\\mathsf{Subst}_{631}\\)</span> 的扩张满足：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma(\\operatorname{atom}(p))=\\sigma(p),\\quad\n\\widehat\\sigma(\\bot)=\\bot,\\quad\n\\widehat\\sigma(\\neg A)=\\neg\\widehat\\sigma(A),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\widehat\\sigma(\\operatorname{atom}(p))=\\sigma(p),\\quad\n\\widehat\\sigma(\\bot)=\\bot,\\quad\n\\widehat\\sigma(\\neg A)=\\neg\\widehat\\sigma(A),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma(A\\to B)=\\widehat\\sigma(A)\\to\\widehat\\sigma(B),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\widehat\\sigma(A\\to B)=\\widehat\\sigma(A)\\to\\widehat\\sigma(B),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma(XA)=X\\widehat\\sigma(A),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\widehat\\sigma(XA)=X\\widehat\\sigma(A),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma(A\\,U\\,B)=\\widehat\\sigma(A)\\,U\\,\\widehat\\sigma(B).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\widehat\\sigma(A\\,U\\,B)=\\widehat\\sigma(A)\\,U\\,\\widehat\\sigma(B).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\equiv_{\\alpha,631}B\">\\(A\\equiv_{\\alpha,631}B\\)</span> 当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A=B\">\\(A=B\\)</span>。</p>\n<h1 id=\"5.-公理集合\">5. 公理集合</h1>\n<p>命题公理三族：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,1}^{631}=\\{A\\to(B\\to A):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{631}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,1}^{631}=\\{A\\to(B\\to A):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{631}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,2}^{631}=\\{(A\\to(B\\to C))\\to((A\\to B)\\to(A\\to C)):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{631}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,2}^{631}=\\{(A\\to(B\\to C))\\to((A\\to B)\\to(A\\to C)):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{631}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,3}^{631}=\\{((\\neg A\\to\\neg B)\\to(B\\to A)):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{631}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,3}^{631}=\\{((\\neg A\\to\\neg B)\\to(B\\to A)):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{631}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>LTL 公理族：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{XK}^{631}=\\{X(A\\to B)\\to(XA\\to XB):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{631}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{XK}^{631}=\\{X(A\\to B)\\to(XA\\to XB):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{631}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{UFix}^{631}=\\{(A\\,U\\,B)\\leftrightarrow(B\\lor(A\\land X(A\\,U\\,B))):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{631}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{UFix}^{631}=\\{(A\\,U\\,B)\\leftrightarrow(B\\lor(A\\land X(A\\,U\\,B))):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{631}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>总公理集合：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{631}\n=\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,1}^{631}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,2}^{631}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,3}^{631}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{XK}^{631}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{UFix}^{631}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{631}\n=\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,1}^{631}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,2}^{631}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,3}^{631}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{XK}^{631}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{UFix}^{631}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"6.-推理规则关系\">6. 推理规则关系</h1>\n<p>分离规则显示为：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\frac{A\\qquad A\\to B}{B}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\frac{A\\qquad A\\to B}{B}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{631}=\\{((A,A\\to B),B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{631}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{631}=\\{((A,A\\to B),B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{631}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>下一步必然化规则显示为：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\frac{A}{XA}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\frac{A}{XA}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{NecX}^{631}=\\{((A),XA):A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{631}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{NecX}^{631}=\\{((A),XA):A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{631}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>直到归纳规则显示为：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\frac{C\\to(B\\lor(A\\land XC))}{C\\to(A\\,U\\,B)}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\frac{C\\to(B\\lor(A\\land XC))}{C\\to(A\\,U\\,B)}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{IndU}^{631}=\\{((C\\to(B\\lor(A\\land XC))),C\\to(A\\,U\\,B)):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{631}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{IndU}^{631}=\\{((C\\to(B\\lor(A\\land XC))),C\\to(A\\,U\\,B)):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{631}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{631}=\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{631}\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{NecX}^{631}\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{IndU}^{631}\">\\(\\mathsf{Rule}_{631}=\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{631}\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{NecX}^{631}\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{IndU}^{631}\\)</span>。</p>\n<h1 id=\"7.-证明对象\">7. 证明对象</h1>\n<p>令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{631}\">\\(\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{631}\\)</span>。一个从 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\">\\(\\Gamma\\)</span> 出发的 631-证明是非空有限序列</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\pi=((\\Delta_i,A_i))_{i&lt;m}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\pi=((\\Delta_i,A_i))_{i&lt;m}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>满足</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"m\\in\\mathbb N,\\quad m&gt;0,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[m\\in\\mathbb N,\\quad m&gt;0,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>并且对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i&lt;m\">\\(i&lt;m\\)</span>，</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i\\subseteq_{\\mathrm{fin}}\\mathsf{Frm}_{631},\n\\qquad\nA_i\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{631}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Delta_i\\subseteq_{\\mathrm{fin}}\\mathsf{Frm}_{631},\n\\qquad\nA_i\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{631}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>每行至少满足下列条件之一：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i\\in\\Gamma\">\\(A_i\\in\\Gamma\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i=\\{A_i\\}\">\\(\\Delta_i=\\{A_i\\}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{631}\">\\(A_i\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{631}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\">\\(\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j,k&lt;i\">\\(j,k&lt;i\\)</span>，使得</li>\n</ol>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"((A_j,A_k),A_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{631},\n\\qquad\n\\Delta_i=\\Delta_j\\cup\\Delta_k.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[((A_j,A_k),A_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{631},\n\\qquad\n\\Delta_i=\\Delta_j\\cup\\Delta_k.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><ol start=\"4\">\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j&lt;i\">\\(j&lt;i\\)</span>，使得</li>\n</ol>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"((A_j),A_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{NecX}^{631},\n\\qquad\n\\Delta_j=\\Delta_i=\\varnothing.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[((A_j),A_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{NecX}^{631},\n\\qquad\n\\Delta_j=\\Delta_i=\\varnothing.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><ol start=\"5\">\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j&lt;i\">\\(j&lt;i\\)</span>，使得</li>\n</ol>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"((A_j),A_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{IndU}^{631},\n\\qquad\n\\Delta_j=\\Delta_i=\\varnothing.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[((A_j),A_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{IndU}^{631},\n\\qquad\n\\Delta_j=\\Delta_i=\\varnothing.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Proof}_{631}(\\Gamma)\">\\(\\mathsf{Proof}_{631}(\\Gamma)\\)</span> 为所有满足上述条件的非空有限序列的集合。</p>\n<h1 id=\"8.-可证性\">8. 可证性</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\vdash_{631}A\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Gamma\\vdash_{631}A\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>当且仅当存在从 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\">\\(\\Gamma\\)</span> 出发的 631-证明 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi=((\\Delta_i,A_i))_{i&lt;m}\">\\(\\pi=((\\Delta_i,A_i))_{i&lt;m}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i&lt;m\">\\(i&lt;m\\)</span>，使得</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"A_i=A,\n\\qquad\n\\Delta_i\\subseteq\\Gamma.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[A_i=A,\n\\qquad\n\\Delta_i\\subseteq\\Gamma.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Thm}_{631}=\\{A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{631}:\\varnothing\\vdash_{631}A\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Thm}_{631}=\\{A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{631}:\\varnothing\\vdash_{631}A\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"9.-目标区分\">9. 目标区分</h1>\n<p>LTL 的目标构造子是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span> 与二元 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\">\\(U\\)</span>；本文件不包含过去算子、路径量词或度量区间参数。</p>\n<h1 id=\"10.-线性时间结构\">10. 线性时间结构</h1>\n<p>定义 LTL 迹集合：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Trace}_{631}\n=\n\\{\\nu:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Prop}_{631})\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Trace}_{631}\n=\n\\{\\nu:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Prop}_{631})\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义后继关系与可达关系：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Succ}_{631}(i,j)\n\\quad\\Longleftrightarrow\\quad\nj=i+1,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Succ}_{631}(i,j)\n\\quad\\Longleftrightarrow\\quad\nj=i+1,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Reach}_{631}(i,j)\n\\quad\\Longleftrightarrow\\quad\ni\\le j.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Reach}_{631}(i,j)\n\\quad\\Longleftrightarrow\\quad\ni\\le j.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"11.-满足关系\">11. 满足关系</h1>\n<p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Vdash_{631}\\subseteq\\mathsf{Trace}_{631}\\times\\mathbb N\\times\\mathsf{Frm}_{631}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Vdash_{631}\\subseteq\\mathsf{Trace}_{631}\\times\\mathbb N\\times\\mathsf{Frm}_{631}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>为满足下列递归子句的最小关系。</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\nu,k\\Vdash_{631}\\operatorname{atom}(p)\n\\quad\\Longleftrightarrow\\quad\np\\in\\nu(k).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\nu,k\\Vdash_{631}\\operatorname{atom}(p)\n\\quad\\Longleftrightarrow\\quad\np\\in\\nu(k).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\nu,k\\not\\Vdash_{631}\\bot.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\nu,k\\not\\Vdash_{631}\\bot.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\nu,k\\Vdash_{631}\\neg A\n\\quad\\Longleftrightarrow\\quad\n\\nu,k\\not\\Vdash_{631}A.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\nu,k\\Vdash_{631}\\neg A\n\\quad\\Longleftrightarrow\\quad\n\\nu,k\\not\\Vdash_{631}A.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\nu,k\\Vdash_{631}A\\to B\n\\quad\\Longleftrightarrow\\quad\n\\nu,k\\not\\Vdash_{631}A\\ \\text{或}\\ \\nu,k\\Vdash_{631}B.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\nu,k\\Vdash_{631}A\\to B\n\\quad\\Longleftrightarrow\\quad\n\\nu,k\\not\\Vdash_{631}A\\ \\text{或}\\ \\nu,k\\Vdash_{631}B.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\nu,k\\Vdash_{631}XA\n\\quad\\Longleftrightarrow\\quad\n\\nu,k+1\\Vdash_{631}A.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\nu,k\\Vdash_{631}XA\n\\quad\\Longleftrightarrow\\quad\n\\nu,k+1\\Vdash_{631}A.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\nu,k\\Vdash_{631}A\\,U\\,B\n\\quad\\Longleftrightarrow\\quad\n\\exists j\\in\\mathbb N\\,\n\\bigl(\nk\\le j\\wedge\n\\nu,j\\Vdash_{631}B\\wedge\n\\forall h\\in\\mathbb N\\,(k\\le h&lt;j\\to\\nu,h\\Vdash_{631}A)\n\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\nu,k\\Vdash_{631}A\\,U\\,B\n\\quad\\Longleftrightarrow\\quad\n\\exists j\\in\\mathbb N\\,\n\\bigl(\nk\\le j\\wedge\n\\nu,j\\Vdash_{631}B\\wedge\n\\forall h\\in\\mathbb N\\,(k\\le h&lt;j\\to\\nu,h\\Vdash_{631}A)\n\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"12.-语义后果\">12. 语义后果</h1>\n<p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{631}\">\\(\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{631}\\)</span>，定义：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\models_{631}A\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Gamma\\models_{631}A\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>当且仅当对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\nu\\in\\mathsf{Trace}_{631}\">\\(\\nu\\in\\mathsf{Trace}_{631}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(k\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\bigl(\\forall B\\in\\Gamma\\ \\nu,k\\Vdash_{631}B\\bigr)\n\\Longrightarrow\n\\nu,k\\Vdash_{631}A.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\bigl(\\forall B\\in\\Gamma\\ \\nu,k\\Vdash_{631}B\\bigr)\n\\Longrightarrow\n\\nu,k\\Vdash_{631}A.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义空前提语义后果集合：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Val}_{631}\n=\n\\{A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{631}:\\varnothing\\models_{631}A\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Val}_{631}\n=\n\\{A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{631}:\\varnothing\\models_{631}A\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"13.-整个形式系统\">13. 整个形式系统</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{LTL}_{631}\n=\n(\\mathsf{Prop}_{631},\\mathsf{Frm}_{631},\\operatorname{FV}_{631},\\operatorname{BV}_{631},\n\\mathsf{Subst}_{631},\\operatorname{PSub}_{631},\\equiv_{\\alpha,631},\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{631},\\mathsf{Rule}_{631},\\mathsf{Proof}_{631},\\vdash_{631},\\mathsf{Thm}_{631},\n\\mathsf{Trace}_{631},\\operatorname{Succ}_{631},\\operatorname{Reach}_{631},\n\\Vdash_{631},\\models_{631},\\mathsf{Val}_{631}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal{LTL}_{631}\n=\n(\\mathsf{Prop}_{631},\\mathsf{Frm}_{631},\\operatorname{FV}_{631},\\operatorname{BV}_{631},\n\\mathsf{Subst}_{631},\\operatorname{PSub}_{631},\\equiv_{\\alpha,631},\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{631},\\mathsf{Rule}_{631},\\mathsf{Proof}_{631},\\vdash_{631},\\mathsf{Thm}_{631},\n\\mathsf{Trace}_{631},\\operatorname{Succ}_{631},\\operatorname{Reach}_{631},\n\\Vdash_{631},\\models_{631},\\mathsf{Val}_{631}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>该系统含线性时序句法、Hilbert 证明对象与基于无限自然数迹的满足关系；自动机翻译、完备性证明和检测算法未纳入本对象。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"1.-符号表","text":"1. 符号表","level":1},{"id":"2.-公式","text":"2. 公式","level":1},{"id":"3.-自由变元","text":"3. 自由变元","level":1},{"id":"4.-命题替换","text":"4. 命题替换","level":1},{"id":"5.-公理集合","text":"5. 公理集合","level":1},{"id":"6.-推理规则关系","text":"6. 推理规则关系","level":1},{"id":"7.-证明对象","text":"7. 证明对象","level":1},{"id":"8.-可证性","text":"8. 可证性","level":1},{"id":"9.-目标区分","text":"9. 目标区分","level":1},{"id":"10.-线性时间结构","text":"10. 线性时间结构","level":1},{"id":"11.-满足关系","text":"11. 满足关系","level":1},{"id":"12.-语义后果","text":"12. 语义后果","level":1},{"id":"13.-整个形式系统","text":"13. 整个形式系统","level":1}],"links":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathbb N=\\{0,1,2,\\ldots\\},\n\\qquad\n\\mathsf{Prop}_{631}=\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"X\\subseteq_{\\mathrm{fin}}Y\n\\Longleftrightarrow\nX\\subseteq Y\\text{ 且 }X\\text{ 有限}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{atom},\\quad\\bot,\\quad\\operatorname{neg},\\quad\\operatorname{imp},\\quad\\operatorname{next},\\quad\\operatorname{until}.","display":true},{"tex":"XA=\\operatorname{next}(A),\\qquad A\\,U\\,B=\\operatorname{until}(A,B).","display":true},{"tex":"\\top=(\\bot\\to\\bot),\\quad\nA\\land B=\\neg(A\\to\\neg B),\\quad\nA\\lor B=\\neg A\\to B,\\quad\nA\\leftrightarrow B=(A\\to B)\\land(B\\to A),\\quad\nFA=\\top\\,U\\,A,\\quad\nGA=\\neg F\\neg A.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Frm}_{631}","display":false},{"tex":"p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}_{631}","di